#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:5
msgid "Auto numbering properties"
msgstr "自动编号属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:7
msgid ""
"For managing projects during manufacturing, erection, commissioning and "
"maintenance phase; a codification criteria has to be defined in the "
"engineering phase, otherwise, the work is inefficient and the project a "
"chaos."
msgstr "在制造、安装、调试和维护阶段管理项目时，必须在工程设计阶段确定编码规则，否则工作效率低下，项目也会陷入混乱。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:11
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows defining auto numbering patterns in the project "
"properties for the codification of `elements`_, `conductors`_ and `folios`_."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 允许在项目属性中定义自动编号模式，用于对 `元件 <elements_>`_ 、 `导体 <conductors_>`_ 和 "
"`图幅 <folios_>`_ 进行编码。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:14
msgid ""
"Every time that a new folio is added to the `project`_ or an `element`_ or "
"`conductor`_ is drawn in the `workspace`_; the `folio`_, `element`_ or "
"`conductor`_ is codified according to the selected pattern in `auto "
"numbering selection panel`_."
msgstr ""
"每当向 `项目 <project_>`_ 中添加新图幅，或在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中绘制 `元件 <element_>`_ 或 "
"`导体 <conductor_>`_ 时， `图幅 <folio_>`_ 、 `元件 <element_>`_ 或 `导体 <conductor_>`_"
" 都会按照 `自动编号选择面板 <auto numbering selection panel_>`_ 中选定的模式进行编码。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:19
msgid "Figure: Project management properties window"
msgstr "图：项目管理属性窗口"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:22
msgid "Display auto numbering properties from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏显示自动编号属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **Project > Project properties** menu item to display the project "
"properties PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **项目 > 项目属性** 菜单项以显示项目属性弹出窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:25
msgid "Go to **Auto Numbering** project properties section."
msgstr "转到 **自动编号** 项目属性部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:26
#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:34
msgid ""
"Go to **Conductor**, **Element** or **Folio** tab to display the desired "
"auto numbering patterns."
msgstr "转到 **导体** 、 **元件** 或 **图幅** 标签页，以显示所需的自动编号模式。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:29
msgid "Display auto numbering properties from panel"
msgstr "从面板显示自动编号属性"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:31
msgid ""
"The project auto numbering properties can be displayed from `auto numbering "
"selection panel`_."
msgstr "项目自动编号属性可以从 `自动编号选择面板 <auto numbering selection panel_>`_ 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:33
msgid ""
"Press |configure| **Configure** button from `auto numbering selection "
"panel`_ to display **Auto Numbering** project properties section at a PopUp "
"window."
msgstr ""
"从 `自动编号选择面板 <auto numbering selection panel_>`_ 中按下 |configure| **配置** "
"按钮，即可在弹出窗口中显示 **自动编号** 项目属性部分。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:48
msgid "configure"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:38
msgid ""
"If the `auto numbering selection panel`_ is not displayed, it can be "
"displayed from **Settings > Display > Selection properties**."
msgstr ""
"如果未显示 `自动编号选择面板 <auto numbering selection panel_>`_ ，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 选择属性** "
"中将其显示。"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:42
msgid "For more information about auto numbering pattern definition refer to:"
msgstr "关于自动编号模式定义的更多信息，请参阅："

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:44
msgid "Folio numbering section"
msgstr "图幅编号部分"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:45
msgid "`Conductor numbering section`_"
msgstr "`导体编号部分 <Conductor numbering section_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/project/properties/numbering_prop.rst:46
msgid "`Element numbering section`_"
msgstr "`元件编号部分 <Element numbering section_>`_"
